OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at junction while TT
OL,4,Afootbridge removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a busy junction in the Isle of
OL,7,FMan's capital is set to be closed on
OL,8,FSaturday while a metal footbridge is
OL,9,Fremoved.
OL,11,FThe bridge, which allows people to
OL,12,Fcross over the TT course during road
OL,13,Fclosures for racing, is at St Ninian's
OL,14,FCrossroads in Douglas.
OL,16,FThe work will see the closure of a
OL,17,Fsection of a section of Bray Hill along
OL,18,Fwith its junctions with Ballaquayle
OL,19,FRoad, Glencrutchery Road and Ballanard
OL,20,FRoad between 06:00 BST and 09:00.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
