OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at junction while TT
OL,4,Afootbridge removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe following Saturday, 18 October, has
OL,7,Fbeen earmarked as a contingency date
OL,8,Fshould the removal be postponed due to
OL,9,Fpoor weather.
